Package: synergyMixR
Type: Package
Title: Mixture-Based Muscle Synergy Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yusuke", "Matsui",
           email = "matsui@nagoya-u.jp",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Author: Yusuke Matsui [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Yusuke Matsui <matsui@nagoya-u.jp>
Description: Provides tools for analyzing muscle synergy using various
    statistical methods including MPCA and MFA. Enables researchers to identify
    distinct subgroups within populations that exhibit different muscle synergy
    patterns, rather than forcing all subjects into a single global model.
License: GPL-3 + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/matsui-lab/synergyMixR
